{const c={"id":"cementing-quality-v22","sceneId":"c1","title":"固井质量智能评价：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"固井后，水泥环位于套管与地层之间，为层间封隔提供基础。声波胶结测井通过套管波衰减等响应辅助评价胶结，不能仅凭单一幅度证明封隔可靠。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"多特征监督类中心分类","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"好、中、差三类胶结候选","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"使用合成 CBL 和纹理代理，未实现真实 VDL 图像识别；微环隙和快速地层可能干扰解释。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固井概念示意\"><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"95\" r=\"78\" fill=\"#d0bc99\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"95\" r=\"61\" fill=\"#dfead7\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"95\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#77978a\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"95\" r=\"32\" fill=\"#f9faf3\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"235\" y=\"50\">外圈：地层；浅绿：水泥环；内圈：套管</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"95\">声波响应辅助判断套管外侧胶结</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"140\">弱套管波通常提示较强衰减，但需综合解释</text></g></svg><figcaption>仅作概念示意，非工程比例或现场压力剖面。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固井质量智能评价概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">固井质量智能评价</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">声源 → 套管波与地层波 → 多特征分类 → 综合复核</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">声波 / 施工 / 几何 → 建模与优化 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>固井后，水泥环位于套管与地层之间，为层间封隔提供基础。声波胶结测井通过套管波衰减等响应辅助评价胶结，不能仅凭单一幅度证明封隔可靠。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理。方法：多特征监督类中心分类。输出：好、中、差三类胶结候选。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>对齐 CBL 与施工记录</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习三类响应中心</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>独立井段分类</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>与幅度阈值基线比较</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>声源 → 套管波与地层波 → 多特征分类 → 综合复核。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；分类与回归从独立合成训练样本学习；居中度例使用组合优化，不训练模型。规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>使用合成 CBL 和纹理代理，未实现真实 VDL 图像识别；微环隙和快速地层可能干扰解释。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/cement_bond_log\">SLB：固井胶结测井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"固井质量智能评价：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 对齐 CBL 与施工记录","role":"数据","do":"CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习三类响应中心","role":"学习","do":"回归与分类从独立样本学习；居中度例建立简化几何响应与优化目标。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 独立井段分类","role":"推理","do":"声源 → 套管波与地层波 → 多特征分类 → 综合复核；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 与幅度阈值基线比较","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"使用合成 CBL 和纹理代理，未实现真实 VDL 图像识别；微环隙和快速地层可能干扰解释。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>对齐 CBL 与施工记录</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习三类响应中心</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>独立井段分类</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>与幅度阈值基线比较</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"使用合成 CBL 和纹理代理，未实现真实 VDL 图像识别；微环隙和快速地层可能干扰解释。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2872,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>固井质量智能评价</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>固井质量智能评价</h1><p class=\"lead\">固井后，水泥环位于套管与地层之间，为层间封隔提供基础。声波胶结测井通过套管波衰减等响应辅助评价胶结，不能仅凭单一幅度证明封隔可靠。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>CBL 幅度偏移（mV） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"CBL 幅度偏移（mV）\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"40\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 不利裕度 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">类别：0好、1中、2差。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>CBL幅度观测序列</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"CBL幅度观测序列\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>多特征分类、单幅度基线与真值</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"多特征分类、单幅度基线与真值\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>多特征监督类中心分类；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">使用合成 CBL 和纹理代理，未实现真实 VDL 图像识别；微环隙和快速地层可能干扰解释。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":12699,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"quality\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":10,\"inspect\":\"CBL单位mV，纹理为合成代理。真值只用于验收；不能把胶结候选等级直接等同于水力封隔可靠性。\",\"classes\":[\"好\",\"中\",\"差\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v)),sigmoid=v=>1/(1+Math.exp(-v));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='centralize')return null;if(TYPE==='quality'){let centers=[[0,0],[0,0],[0,0]],base=[[.2,.8],[.5,.5],[.8,.2]];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let k=i%3;for(let j=0;j<2;j++)centers[k][j]+=(base[k][j]+(r()-.5)*.14)/120}return{centers,base}}if(TYPE==='loss'){let samples=[];for(let i=0;i<600;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),x=[1,a,b],prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b);samples.push({x,y:r()<prob?1:0})}let w=[0,0,0];for(let e=0;e<350;e++){let g=[0,0,0];for(let d of samples){let p=sigmoid(predict(w,d.x));for(let j=0;j<3;j++)g[j]+=(p-d.y)*d.x[j]}for(let j=0;j<3;j++)w[j]-=.1*g[j]/samples.length}return w}let data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let q=r(),c=r(),x=[1,q,c,q*q];data.push({x,y:55+40*q-12*c-12*q*q+(r()-.5)*2})}return fit(data)})();\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;const accuracy=(a,b)=>(100*a.filter((v,i)=>v===b[i]).length/a.length).toFixed(1)+'%';\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='quality'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],amp=[],texture=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1));x[0]=clamp(x[0]+param/100,0,1);let dist=model.centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));truth.push(y);pred.push(dist.indexOf(Math.min(...dist)));base.push(x[0]<.35?0:x[0]<.65?1:2);amp.push(x[0]*100);texture.push(x[1])}chart('a',[{values:amp,color:'#43836b'}],0,110,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 0.5 m）','CBL 合成幅度 / mV');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.3,'采样序号 / 0.5 m 步长','0 好 / 1 中 / 2 差（教学编码）');metrics([['多特征准确率',accuracy(truth,pred)],['单幅度基线',accuracy(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['幅度系统偏移',param+' mV']]);$('explain').textContent='360 个训练样本学习 CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理特征的类别中心；测试不使用真值推理。橙：真值；绿：多特征；蓝：单幅度阈值。第一滑块模拟幅度系统偏移，观察仅靠幅度的误判。纹理是数值代理，不是真实 VDL；较弱套管波一般有利于胶结解释，但微环隙、快速地层等可能干扰，不能由等级直接证明水力封隔。';head=['depth_m','CBL_mV','texture_proxy','truth','multifeature_class','amplitude_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*.5,amp[i],texture[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='optimize'){let upper=param/100,eff=[],ecd=[],valid=[],best=null;for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let q=.5+i*.03,nq=(q-.5)/3,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,estimated=predict(model,[1,nq,c,nq*nq]),equiv=1.60+.03*q*q+noise*.02;eff.push(estimated);ecd.push(equiv);valid.push(equiv<=upper&&equiv>=1.65?1:0);if(valid[i]&&(!best||estimated>best.eff))best={q,eff:estimated,ecd:equiv}}chart('a',[{values:eff,color:'#43836b'}],30,100,'候选序号（排量 = 0.5 + 序号 × 0.03 m³/min）','代理顶替效率 / %');chart('b',[{values:ecd,color:'#43836b'},{values:ecd.map(()=>upper),color:'#c59048'},{values:ecd.map(()=>1.65),color:'#648eae'}],1.5,2.1,'候选排量序号','演示 ECD / g·cm⁻³');metrics([['可行候选',valid.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 100'],['推荐排量',best?best.q.toFixed(2)+' m³/min':'无可行方案'],['预测效率',best?best.eff.toFixed(1)+'%':'—'],['推荐点 ECD',best?best.ecd.toFixed(3):'—']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成施工样本拟合排量、偏心代理与效率的岭回归模型，再遍历候选排量。ECD 用教学式 1.60 + 0.03q² + 扰动裕度计算，只保留在蓝色下限 1.65 与橙色上限之间的点。第一滑块为上限×100，第二滑块增加保守密度裕度。效率最高的可行候选作为建议；无可行点时明确返回无解，不强行推荐。并非真实水力或完整浆柱设计。';head=['candidate','flow_m3_min','predicted_eff_pct','ECD_g_cm3','feasible','selected'];rows=eff.map((v,i)=>[i,.5+i*.03,v,ecd[i],valid[i],best&&Math.abs(.5+i*.03-best.q)<1e-8?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='loss'){let truth=[],pred=[],baseline=[],probs=[],margins=[];for(let i=0;i<180;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b),y=r()<prob?1:0,obs=clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,-1,1),score=sigmoid(predict(model,[1,obs,b]));truth.push(y);probs.push(score);margins.push(obs);pred.push(score>param/100?1:0);baseline.push(obs>0?1:0)}function count(a){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{fp,fn,f:(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%'}}let c=count(pred);chart('a',[{values:probs,color:'#43836b'},{values:probs.map(()=>param/100),color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'独立测试井次序号','逻辑回归风险分数 / 阈值');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'测试井次（分层显示二元事件）','橙真值=1 / 绿报警=0.8 / 蓝基线=0.6');metrics([['学习模型 F1',c.f],['裕度阈值基线 F1',count(baseline).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['测试漏失事件',truth.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 180']]);$('explain').textContent='600 个合成历史井次通过梯度下降拟合逻辑回归，输入为归一化超压裕度（正值偏危险）和地层弱化代理。180 个独立测试井次按生成概率随机产生事件，因此存在不可消除的不确定性。第一滑块调报警阈值；分数未经真实现场校准，不能报告为现场漏失概率。第二滑块只改变观测误差，不改变同一种子下的事件真值。';head=['well_index','observed_margin_proxy','risk_score','truth_loss','alarm','margin_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,margins[i],probs[i],v,pred[i],baseline[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='centralize'){let n=60,budget=param,severity=Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>.3+.6*Math.exp(-(((i-35)/12)**2))+.25*r()),places=[],baseplaces=Array.from({length:budget},(_,k)=>Math.round((k+.5)*n/budget));function profile(set){return severity.map((s,i)=>{let dist=set.length?Math.min(...set.map(p=>Math.abs(p-i))):n;let ecc=clamp((.2+.8*s+noise*.2)*dist/14,0,.98);return 100*(1-ecc)})}for(let k=0;k<budget;k++){let best=null;for(let p=0;p<n;p++){if(places.includes(p))continue;let values=profile([...places,p]),cost=values.reduce((s,v)=>s+Math.max(0,70-v)**2,0);if(!best||cost<best.cost)best={p,cost}}places.push(best.p)}let optimized=profile(places),baseline=profile(baseplaces);chart('a',[{values:optimized,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'},{values:optimized.map(()=>70),color:'#c59048'}],0,105,'井段序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 2 m）','模拟居中度（standoff）/ %');chart('b',[{values:places.length?Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>places.includes(i)?1:0):[],color:'#43836b'},{values:Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>baseplaces.includes(i)?.7:0),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'井段序号（绿优化位置 / 蓝均匀位置）','位置指示（绿=1，蓝=0.7）');let cover=a=>(100*a.filter(v=>v>=70).length/n).toFixed(1)+'%';metrics([['优化达标比例',cover(optimized)],['均匀布置达标比例',cover(baseline)],['扶正器预算',budget+' 个'],['优化最小居中度',Math.min(...optimized).toFixed(1)+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='用简化偏心—距离响应预测居中度 S = 100×(1−e/c)，e 为偏心距、c 为同心径向间隙。按预算逐个选位置，使低于教学目标 70% 的平方缺口总和最小；对比同预算均匀布置。第二滑块增加井段不利程度。属于贪心组合优化，不训练机器学习模型，也不保证全局最优；未考虑扶正器载荷、摩阻、弯曲或可下入性。70% 仅为教学目标。';head=['depth_m','severity_proxy','optimized_standoff_pct','uniform_standoff_pct','optimized_device','uniform_device'];rows=optimized.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*2,severity[i],v,baseline[i],places.includes(i)?1:0,baseplaces.includes(i)?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='cement-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='centralize'?'几何响应与贪心组合优化；不训练机器学习模型。目标为低于70%的居中度平方缺口之和，未保证全局最优。':JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='quality'||TYPE==='loss'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='optimize'?+(r[4]===0):Math.max(0,70-r[2])),max=Math.max(1,...a),label=TYPE==='optimize'?'不可行候选位置：高柱表示不满足压力窗口':TYPE==='centralize'?'逐井段未达教学居中度目标的缺口（百分点）':'逐点分类错误：高柱表示判错';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v/max*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85*v/max:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"cementing-optimize-v22","sceneId":"c2","title":"注水泥参数优化：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"注水泥设计需兼顾顶替效果与压力窗口。循环流动的环空摩阻会增加等效循环密度 ECD，静态浆体密度并不能完整代表施工时的压力作用。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"岭回归代理 + 约束网格搜索","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"压力窗口内的候选排量与效率","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"只搜索排量；密度与水力关系均为教学假设，不设计实际浆柱结构、流变性或替浆工艺。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固井概念示意\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"20\" width=\"180\" height=\"145\" fill=\"#e3eedb\"/><path d=\"M40 45H220M40 140H220\" stroke=\"#c59048\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M60 120L105 100L155 75L200 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"250\" y=\"50\">压力窗口上限：地层承受能力的教学代理</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"95\">绿色：排量提高带来的 ECD 变化示意</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"140\">上穿窗口 → 漏失风险；可行域内再寻优</text></g></svg><figcaption>仅作概念示意，非工程比例或现场压力剖面。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"注水泥参数优化概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">注水泥参数优化</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">施工样本 → 效率代理 → 压力约束筛选 → 候选排序</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">声波 / 施工 / 几何 → 建模与优化 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>注水泥设计需兼顾顶替效果与压力窗口。循环流动的环空摩阻会增加等效循环密度 ECD，静态浆体密度并不能完整代表施工时的压力作用。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：归一化排量、偏心代理、合成效率标签。方法：岭回归代理 + 约束网格搜索。输出：压力窗口内的候选排量与效率。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>规范施工样本</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习效率代理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>筛选压力窗口可行域</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>输出最佳候选或无解</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>施工样本 → 效率代理 → 压力约束筛选 → 候选排序。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的归一化排量、偏心代理、合成效率标签，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；分类与回归从独立合成训练样本学习；居中度例使用组合优化，不训练模型。规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>只搜索排量；密度与水力关系均为教学假设，不设计实际浆柱结构、流变性或替浆工艺。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/cement_bond_log\">SLB：固井胶结测井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"注水泥参数优化：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 规范施工样本","role":"数据","do":"归一化排量、偏心代理、合成效率标签按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习效率代理","role":"学习","do":"回归与分类从独立样本学习；居中度例建立简化几何响应与优化目标。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 筛选压力窗口可行域","role":"推理","do":"施工样本 → 效率代理 → 压力约束筛选 → 候选排序；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 输出最佳候选或无解","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"只搜索排量；密度与水力关系均为教学假设，不设计实际浆柱结构、流变性或替浆工艺。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>规范施工样本</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习效率代理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>筛选压力窗口可行域</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>输出最佳候选或无解</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"只搜索排量；密度与水力关系均为教学假设，不设计实际浆柱结构、流变性或替浆工艺。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2887,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>注水泥参数优化</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>注水泥参数优化</h1><p class=\"lead\">注水泥设计需兼顾顶替效果与压力窗口。循环流动的环空摩阻会增加等效循环密度 ECD，静态浆体密度并不能完整代表施工时的压力作用。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>压力窗口上限 ×100 <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"压力窗口上限 ×100\" type=\"range\" min=\"160\" max=\"205\" value=\"185\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 不利裕度 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值；绿：学习/优化；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>候选排量与代理顶替效率</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"候选排量与代理顶替效率\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>ECD与压力窗口上下限</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"ECD与压力窗口上下限\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>岭回归代理 + 约束网格搜索；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">只搜索排量；密度与水力关系均为教学假设，不设计实际浆柱结构、流变性或替浆工艺。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":12753,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"optimize\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":185,\"inspect\":\"排量单位m³/min，ECD单位g/cm³。feasible=1表示满足教学压力窗口；selected=1为同一可行域中效率最高的候选。无可行点时不输出推荐。\",\"classes\":[\"见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v)),sigmoid=v=>1/(1+Math.exp(-v));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='centralize')return null;if(TYPE==='quality'){let centers=[[0,0],[0,0],[0,0]],base=[[.2,.8],[.5,.5],[.8,.2]];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let k=i%3;for(let j=0;j<2;j++)centers[k][j]+=(base[k][j]+(r()-.5)*.14)/120}return{centers,base}}if(TYPE==='loss'){let samples=[];for(let i=0;i<600;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),x=[1,a,b],prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b);samples.push({x,y:r()<prob?1:0})}let w=[0,0,0];for(let e=0;e<350;e++){let g=[0,0,0];for(let d of samples){let p=sigmoid(predict(w,d.x));for(let j=0;j<3;j++)g[j]+=(p-d.y)*d.x[j]}for(let j=0;j<3;j++)w[j]-=.1*g[j]/samples.length}return w}let data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let q=r(),c=r(),x=[1,q,c,q*q];data.push({x,y:55+40*q-12*c-12*q*q+(r()-.5)*2})}return fit(data)})();\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;const accuracy=(a,b)=>(100*a.filter((v,i)=>v===b[i]).length/a.length).toFixed(1)+'%';\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='quality'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],amp=[],texture=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1));x[0]=clamp(x[0]+param/100,0,1);let dist=model.centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));truth.push(y);pred.push(dist.indexOf(Math.min(...dist)));base.push(x[0]<.35?0:x[0]<.65?1:2);amp.push(x[0]*100);texture.push(x[1])}chart('a',[{values:amp,color:'#43836b'}],0,110,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 0.5 m）','CBL 合成幅度 / mV');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.3,'采样序号 / 0.5 m 步长','0 好 / 1 中 / 2 差（教学编码）');metrics([['多特征准确率',accuracy(truth,pred)],['单幅度基线',accuracy(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['幅度系统偏移',param+' mV']]);$('explain').textContent='360 个训练样本学习 CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理特征的类别中心；测试不使用真值推理。橙：真值；绿：多特征；蓝：单幅度阈值。第一滑块模拟幅度系统偏移，观察仅靠幅度的误判。纹理是数值代理，不是真实 VDL；较弱套管波一般有利于胶结解释，但微环隙、快速地层等可能干扰，不能由等级直接证明水力封隔。';head=['depth_m','CBL_mV','texture_proxy','truth','multifeature_class','amplitude_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*.5,amp[i],texture[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='optimize'){let upper=param/100,eff=[],ecd=[],valid=[],best=null;for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let q=.5+i*.03,nq=(q-.5)/3,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,estimated=predict(model,[1,nq,c,nq*nq]),equiv=1.60+.03*q*q+noise*.02;eff.push(estimated);ecd.push(equiv);valid.push(equiv<=upper&&equiv>=1.65?1:0);if(valid[i]&&(!best||estimated>best.eff))best={q,eff:estimated,ecd:equiv}}chart('a',[{values:eff,color:'#43836b'}],30,100,'候选序号（排量 = 0.5 + 序号 × 0.03 m³/min）','代理顶替效率 / %');chart('b',[{values:ecd,color:'#43836b'},{values:ecd.map(()=>upper),color:'#c59048'},{values:ecd.map(()=>1.65),color:'#648eae'}],1.5,2.1,'候选排量序号','演示 ECD / g·cm⁻³');metrics([['可行候选',valid.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 100'],['推荐排量',best?best.q.toFixed(2)+' m³/min':'无可行方案'],['预测效率',best?best.eff.toFixed(1)+'%':'—'],['推荐点 ECD',best?best.ecd.toFixed(3):'—']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成施工样本拟合排量、偏心代理与效率的岭回归模型，再遍历候选排量。ECD 用教学式 1.60 + 0.03q² + 扰动裕度计算，只保留在蓝色下限 1.65 与橙色上限之间的点。第一滑块为上限×100，第二滑块增加保守密度裕度。效率最高的可行候选作为建议；无可行点时明确返回无解，不强行推荐。并非真实水力或完整浆柱设计。';head=['candidate','flow_m3_min','predicted_eff_pct','ECD_g_cm3','feasible','selected'];rows=eff.map((v,i)=>[i,.5+i*.03,v,ecd[i],valid[i],best&&Math.abs(.5+i*.03-best.q)<1e-8?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='loss'){let truth=[],pred=[],baseline=[],probs=[],margins=[];for(let i=0;i<180;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b),y=r()<prob?1:0,obs=clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,-1,1),score=sigmoid(predict(model,[1,obs,b]));truth.push(y);probs.push(score);margins.push(obs);pred.push(score>param/100?1:0);baseline.push(obs>0?1:0)}function count(a){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{fp,fn,f:(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%'}}let c=count(pred);chart('a',[{values:probs,color:'#43836b'},{values:probs.map(()=>param/100),color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'独立测试井次序号','逻辑回归风险分数 / 阈值');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'测试井次（分层显示二元事件）','橙真值=1 / 绿报警=0.8 / 蓝基线=0.6');metrics([['学习模型 F1',c.f],['裕度阈值基线 F1',count(baseline).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['测试漏失事件',truth.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 180']]);$('explain').textContent='600 个合成历史井次通过梯度下降拟合逻辑回归，输入为归一化超压裕度（正值偏危险）和地层弱化代理。180 个独立测试井次按生成概率随机产生事件，因此存在不可消除的不确定性。第一滑块调报警阈值；分数未经真实现场校准，不能报告为现场漏失概率。第二滑块只改变观测误差，不改变同一种子下的事件真值。';head=['well_index','observed_margin_proxy','risk_score','truth_loss','alarm','margin_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,margins[i],probs[i],v,pred[i],baseline[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='centralize'){let n=60,budget=param,severity=Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>.3+.6*Math.exp(-(((i-35)/12)**2))+.25*r()),places=[],baseplaces=Array.from({length:budget},(_,k)=>Math.round((k+.5)*n/budget));function profile(set){return severity.map((s,i)=>{let dist=set.length?Math.min(...set.map(p=>Math.abs(p-i))):n;let ecc=clamp((.2+.8*s+noise*.2)*dist/14,0,.98);return 100*(1-ecc)})}for(let k=0;k<budget;k++){let best=null;for(let p=0;p<n;p++){if(places.includes(p))continue;let values=profile([...places,p]),cost=values.reduce((s,v)=>s+Math.max(0,70-v)**2,0);if(!best||cost<best.cost)best={p,cost}}places.push(best.p)}let optimized=profile(places),baseline=profile(baseplaces);chart('a',[{values:optimized,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'},{values:optimized.map(()=>70),color:'#c59048'}],0,105,'井段序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 2 m）','模拟居中度（standoff）/ %');chart('b',[{values:places.length?Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>places.includes(i)?1:0):[],color:'#43836b'},{values:Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>baseplaces.includes(i)?.7:0),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'井段序号（绿优化位置 / 蓝均匀位置）','位置指示（绿=1，蓝=0.7）');let cover=a=>(100*a.filter(v=>v>=70).length/n).toFixed(1)+'%';metrics([['优化达标比例',cover(optimized)],['均匀布置达标比例',cover(baseline)],['扶正器预算',budget+' 个'],['优化最小居中度',Math.min(...optimized).toFixed(1)+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='用简化偏心—距离响应预测居中度 S = 100×(1−e/c)，e 为偏心距、c 为同心径向间隙。按预算逐个选位置，使低于教学目标 70% 的平方缺口总和最小；对比同预算均匀布置。第二滑块增加井段不利程度。属于贪心组合优化，不训练机器学习模型，也不保证全局最优；未考虑扶正器载荷、摩阻、弯曲或可下入性。70% 仅为教学目标。';head=['depth_m','severity_proxy','optimized_standoff_pct','uniform_standoff_pct','optimized_device','uniform_device'];rows=optimized.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*2,severity[i],v,baseline[i],places.includes(i)?1:0,baseplaces.includes(i)?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='cement-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='centralize'?'几何响应与贪心组合优化；不训练机器学习模型。目标为低于70%的居中度平方缺口之和，未保证全局最优。':JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='quality'||TYPE==='loss'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='optimize'?+(r[4]===0):Math.max(0,70-r[2])),max=Math.max(1,...a),label=TYPE==='optimize'?'不可行候选位置：高柱表示不满足压力窗口':TYPE==='centralize'?'逐井段未达教学居中度目标的缺口（百分点）':'逐点分类错误：高柱表示判错';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v/max*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85*v/max:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"cementing-loss-v22","sceneId":"c3","title":"固井漏失风险预测：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"施工压力接近或超过地层承受能力时可能发生漏失，导致返高不足等问题。压力裕度、地层弱化和资料不确定性共同影响风险，不能只用单一参数定论。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"逻辑回归二元分类","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"漏失风险分数及报警候选","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"分数只对合成分布有意义，未作现场概率校准，也未实现压力剖面计算。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固井概念示意\"><rect x=\"40\" y=\"20\" width=\"180\" height=\"145\" fill=\"#e3eedb\"/><path d=\"M40 45H220M40 140H220\" stroke=\"#c59048\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M60 120L105 100L155 75L200 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"250\" y=\"50\">压力窗口上限：地层承受能力的教学代理</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"95\">绿色：排量提高带来的 ECD 变化示意</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"140\">上穿窗口 → 漏失风险；可行域内再寻优</text></g></svg><figcaption>仅作概念示意，非工程比例或现场压力剖面。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固井漏失风险预测概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">固井漏失风险预测</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">历史井次 → 梯度下降训练 → 风险分数 → 阈值权衡</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">声波 / 施工 / 几何 → 建模与优化 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>施工压力接近或超过地层承受能力时可能发生漏失，导致返高不足等问题。压力裕度、地层弱化和资料不确定性共同影响风险，不能只用单一参数定论。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：归一化超压裕度与地层弱化代理。方法：逻辑回归二元分类。输出：漏失风险分数及报警候选。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>构造独立井次标签</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>训练逻辑回归</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>调节阈值报警</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>核对误报漏报与 F1</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>历史井次 → 梯度下降训练 → 风险分数 → 阈值权衡。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的归一化超压裕度与地层弱化代理，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；分类与回归从独立合成训练样本学习；居中度例使用组合优化，不训练模型。规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>分数只对合成分布有意义，未作现场概率校准，也未实现压力剖面计算。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/cement_bond_log\">SLB：固井胶结测井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"固井漏失风险预测：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 构造独立井次标签","role":"数据","do":"归一化超压裕度与地层弱化代理按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 训练逻辑回归","role":"学习","do":"回归与分类从独立样本学习；居中度例建立简化几何响应与优化目标。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 调节阈值报警","role":"推理","do":"历史井次 → 梯度下降训练 → 风险分数 → 阈值权衡；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 核对误报漏报与 F1","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"分数只对合成分布有意义，未作现场概率校准，也未实现压力剖面计算。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>构造独立井次标签</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>训练逻辑回归</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>调节阈值报警</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>核对误报漏报与 F1</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"分数只对合成分布有意义，未作现场概率校准，也未实现压力剖面计算。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2913,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>固井漏失风险预测</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>固井漏失风险预测</h1><p class=\"lead\">施工压力接近或超过地层承受能力时可能发生漏失，导致返高不足等问题。压力裕度、地层弱化和资料不确定性共同影响风险，不能只用单一参数定论。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>报警阈值（百分数） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"报警阈值（百分数）\" type=\"range\" min=\"10\" max=\"90\" value=\"50\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 不利裕度 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值；绿：学习/优化；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>漏失风险分数与报警阈值</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"漏失风险分数与报警阈值\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>真实事件、模型报警与裕度基线</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"真实事件、模型报警与裕度基线\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>逻辑回归二元分类；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">分数只对合成分布有意义，未作现场概率校准，也未实现压力剖面计算。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":12733,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"loss\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":50,\"inspect\":\"风险分数来自逻辑回归，未经现场校准。真实标签是独立合成事件；误报和漏报随阈值变化，不能视为现场事故概率。\",\"classes\":[\"见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v)),sigmoid=v=>1/(1+Math.exp(-v));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='centralize')return null;if(TYPE==='quality'){let centers=[[0,0],[0,0],[0,0]],base=[[.2,.8],[.5,.5],[.8,.2]];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let k=i%3;for(let j=0;j<2;j++)centers[k][j]+=(base[k][j]+(r()-.5)*.14)/120}return{centers,base}}if(TYPE==='loss'){let samples=[];for(let i=0;i<600;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),x=[1,a,b],prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b);samples.push({x,y:r()<prob?1:0})}let w=[0,0,0];for(let e=0;e<350;e++){let g=[0,0,0];for(let d of samples){let p=sigmoid(predict(w,d.x));for(let j=0;j<3;j++)g[j]+=(p-d.y)*d.x[j]}for(let j=0;j<3;j++)w[j]-=.1*g[j]/samples.length}return w}let data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let q=r(),c=r(),x=[1,q,c,q*q];data.push({x,y:55+40*q-12*c-12*q*q+(r()-.5)*2})}return fit(data)})();\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;const accuracy=(a,b)=>(100*a.filter((v,i)=>v===b[i]).length/a.length).toFixed(1)+'%';\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='quality'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],amp=[],texture=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1));x[0]=clamp(x[0]+param/100,0,1);let dist=model.centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));truth.push(y);pred.push(dist.indexOf(Math.min(...dist)));base.push(x[0]<.35?0:x[0]<.65?1:2);amp.push(x[0]*100);texture.push(x[1])}chart('a',[{values:amp,color:'#43836b'}],0,110,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 0.5 m）','CBL 合成幅度 / mV');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.3,'采样序号 / 0.5 m 步长','0 好 / 1 中 / 2 差（教学编码）');metrics([['多特征准确率',accuracy(truth,pred)],['单幅度基线',accuracy(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['幅度系统偏移',param+' mV']]);$('explain').textContent='360 个训练样本学习 CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理特征的类别中心；测试不使用真值推理。橙：真值；绿：多特征；蓝：单幅度阈值。第一滑块模拟幅度系统偏移，观察仅靠幅度的误判。纹理是数值代理，不是真实 VDL；较弱套管波一般有利于胶结解释，但微环隙、快速地层等可能干扰，不能由等级直接证明水力封隔。';head=['depth_m','CBL_mV','texture_proxy','truth','multifeature_class','amplitude_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*.5,amp[i],texture[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='optimize'){let upper=param/100,eff=[],ecd=[],valid=[],best=null;for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let q=.5+i*.03,nq=(q-.5)/3,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,estimated=predict(model,[1,nq,c,nq*nq]),equiv=1.60+.03*q*q+noise*.02;eff.push(estimated);ecd.push(equiv);valid.push(equiv<=upper&&equiv>=1.65?1:0);if(valid[i]&&(!best||estimated>best.eff))best={q,eff:estimated,ecd:equiv}}chart('a',[{values:eff,color:'#43836b'}],30,100,'候选序号（排量 = 0.5 + 序号 × 0.03 m³/min）','代理顶替效率 / %');chart('b',[{values:ecd,color:'#43836b'},{values:ecd.map(()=>upper),color:'#c59048'},{values:ecd.map(()=>1.65),color:'#648eae'}],1.5,2.1,'候选排量序号','演示 ECD / g·cm⁻³');metrics([['可行候选',valid.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 100'],['推荐排量',best?best.q.toFixed(2)+' m³/min':'无可行方案'],['预测效率',best?best.eff.toFixed(1)+'%':'—'],['推荐点 ECD',best?best.ecd.toFixed(3):'—']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成施工样本拟合排量、偏心代理与效率的岭回归模型，再遍历候选排量。ECD 用教学式 1.60 + 0.03q² + 扰动裕度计算，只保留在蓝色下限 1.65 与橙色上限之间的点。第一滑块为上限×100，第二滑块增加保守密度裕度。效率最高的可行候选作为建议；无可行点时明确返回无解，不强行推荐。并非真实水力或完整浆柱设计。';head=['candidate','flow_m3_min','predicted_eff_pct','ECD_g_cm3','feasible','selected'];rows=eff.map((v,i)=>[i,.5+i*.03,v,ecd[i],valid[i],best&&Math.abs(.5+i*.03-best.q)<1e-8?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='loss'){let truth=[],pred=[],baseline=[],probs=[],margins=[];for(let i=0;i<180;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b),y=r()<prob?1:0,obs=clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,-1,1),score=sigmoid(predict(model,[1,obs,b]));truth.push(y);probs.push(score);margins.push(obs);pred.push(score>param/100?1:0);baseline.push(obs>0?1:0)}function count(a){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{fp,fn,f:(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%'}}let c=count(pred);chart('a',[{values:probs,color:'#43836b'},{values:probs.map(()=>param/100),color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'独立测试井次序号','逻辑回归风险分数 / 阈值');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'测试井次（分层显示二元事件）','橙真值=1 / 绿报警=0.8 / 蓝基线=0.6');metrics([['学习模型 F1',c.f],['裕度阈值基线 F1',count(baseline).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['测试漏失事件',truth.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 180']]);$('explain').textContent='600 个合成历史井次通过梯度下降拟合逻辑回归，输入为归一化超压裕度（正值偏危险）和地层弱化代理。180 个独立测试井次按生成概率随机产生事件，因此存在不可消除的不确定性。第一滑块调报警阈值；分数未经真实现场校准，不能报告为现场漏失概率。第二滑块只改变观测误差，不改变同一种子下的事件真值。';head=['well_index','observed_margin_proxy','risk_score','truth_loss','alarm','margin_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,margins[i],probs[i],v,pred[i],baseline[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='centralize'){let n=60,budget=param,severity=Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>.3+.6*Math.exp(-(((i-35)/12)**2))+.25*r()),places=[],baseplaces=Array.from({length:budget},(_,k)=>Math.round((k+.5)*n/budget));function profile(set){return severity.map((s,i)=>{let dist=set.length?Math.min(...set.map(p=>Math.abs(p-i))):n;let ecc=clamp((.2+.8*s+noise*.2)*dist/14,0,.98);return 100*(1-ecc)})}for(let k=0;k<budget;k++){let best=null;for(let p=0;p<n;p++){if(places.includes(p))continue;let values=profile([...places,p]),cost=values.reduce((s,v)=>s+Math.max(0,70-v)**2,0);if(!best||cost<best.cost)best={p,cost}}places.push(best.p)}let optimized=profile(places),baseline=profile(baseplaces);chart('a',[{values:optimized,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'},{values:optimized.map(()=>70),color:'#c59048'}],0,105,'井段序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 2 m）','模拟居中度（standoff）/ %');chart('b',[{values:places.length?Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>places.includes(i)?1:0):[],color:'#43836b'},{values:Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>baseplaces.includes(i)?.7:0),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'井段序号（绿优化位置 / 蓝均匀位置）','位置指示（绿=1，蓝=0.7）');let cover=a=>(100*a.filter(v=>v>=70).length/n).toFixed(1)+'%';metrics([['优化达标比例',cover(optimized)],['均匀布置达标比例',cover(baseline)],['扶正器预算',budget+' 个'],['优化最小居中度',Math.min(...optimized).toFixed(1)+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='用简化偏心—距离响应预测居中度 S = 100×(1−e/c)，e 为偏心距、c 为同心径向间隙。按预算逐个选位置，使低于教学目标 70% 的平方缺口总和最小；对比同预算均匀布置。第二滑块增加井段不利程度。属于贪心组合优化，不训练机器学习模型，也不保证全局最优；未考虑扶正器载荷、摩阻、弯曲或可下入性。70% 仅为教学目标。';head=['depth_m','severity_proxy','optimized_standoff_pct','uniform_standoff_pct','optimized_device','uniform_device'];rows=optimized.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*2,severity[i],v,baseline[i],places.includes(i)?1:0,baseplaces.includes(i)?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='cement-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='centralize'?'几何响应与贪心组合优化；不训练机器学习模型。目标为低于70%的居中度平方缺口之和，未保证全局最优。':JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='quality'||TYPE==='loss'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='optimize'?+(r[4]===0):Math.max(0,70-r[2])),max=Math.max(1,...a),label=TYPE==='optimize'?'不可行候选位置：高柱表示不满足压力窗口':TYPE==='centralize'?'逐井段未达教学居中度目标的缺口（百分点）':'逐点分类错误：高柱表示判错';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v/max*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85*v/max:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}
{const c={"id":"cementing-centralize-v22","sceneId":"c4","title":"套管居中度智能评估：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"套管偏心会使环空间隙一侧变窄，增加顶替不均匀的可能。居中度 standoff 可用最小径向间隙与同心间隙之比描述，扶正器布置需要考虑井径和井斜等条件。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"简化几何响应 + 贪心组合优化","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"扶正器候选位置及模拟居中度","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"不训练机器学习模型；采用组合优化，未模拟受力、摩阻与实际下入条件，不保证全局最优。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<figure style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固井概念示意\"><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"95\" r=\"78\" fill=\"#d0bc99\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"95\" r=\"61\" fill=\"#dfead7\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"95\" r=\"40\" fill=\"#77978a\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"95\" r=\"32\" fill=\"#f9faf3\"/><g font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"235\" y=\"50\">外圈：地层；浅绿：水泥环；内圈：套管</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"95\">偏心使窄边间隙变小，影响顶替均匀性</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"140\">居中度 = 最小径向间隙 / 同心径向间隙</text></g></svg><figcaption>仅作概念示意，非工程比例或现场压力剖面。</figcaption></figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"套管居中度智能评估概念\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"170\" fill=\"#eef4e9\"/><path d=\"M20 130L60 120L100 125L140 60L180 65L220 80L260 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#345648\">套管居中度智能评估</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">井段几何代理 → 居中度响应 → 逐位置搜索 → 同预算对比</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#345648\">声波 / 施工 / 几何 → 建模与优化 → 可复核候选</text></svg><p>概念示意，非现场曲线。具体坐标和单位见案例演示。</p><p>套管偏心会使环空间隙一侧变窄，增加顶替不均匀的可能。居中度 standoff 可用最小径向间隙与同心间隙之比描述，扶正器布置需要考虑井径和井斜等条件。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：合成井段不利程度、可安放位置与数量预算。方法：简化几何响应 + 贪心组合优化。输出：扶正器候选位置及模拟居中度。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>计算井段不利程度</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>定义偏心与居中响应</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>逐个优化安放位置</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较同预算均匀布置</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>井段几何代理 → 居中度响应 → 逐位置搜索 → 同预算对比。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>真实应用需要同井段配对的合成井段不利程度、可安放位置与数量预算，并由施工结果、胶结解释或独立验证资料提供标签。先做小规模概念验证，再按井、样品或连续时间块留出测试，避免相邻样本泄漏。</p><p>本演示训练种子 17、测试初始种子 91；分类与回归从独立合成训练样本学习；居中度例使用组合优化，不训练模型。规模仅作原理说明。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>不训练机器学习模型；采用组合优化，未模拟受力、摩阻与实际下入条件，不保证全局最优。</p><p><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/c/cement_bond_log\">SLB：固井胶结测井概念</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.neighbors.NearestCentroid.html\">最近类中心原理</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归与逻辑回归原理</a>。合成公式与示范为本项目独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"套管居中度智能评估：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 计算井段不利程度","role":"数据","do":"合成井段不利程度、可安放位置与数量预算按深度对齐，按独立井留出测试。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 定义偏心与居中响应","role":"学习","do":"回归与分类从独立样本学习；居中度例建立简化几何响应与优化目标。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 逐个优化安放位置","role":"推理","do":"井段几何代理 → 居中度响应 → 逐位置搜索 → 同预算对比；第一滑块调节当前实验参数。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 比较同预算均匀布置","role":"验收","do":"比较真值与基线，导出 CSV 并复核误差。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"不训练机器学习模型；采用组合优化，未模拟受力、摩阻与实际下入条件，不保证全局最优。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>计算井段不利程度</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>定义偏心与居中响应</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>逐个优化安放位置</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较同预算均匀布置</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>分类准确率 = 正确数 / 测试数；F1 = 2TP/(2TP+FP+FN)。层界按 ±2 m 一对一匹配；报告引用覆盖率仅表示有来源，不等于语义正确率。后验分数未经校准。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"不训练机器学习模型；采用组合优化，未模拟受力、摩阻与实际下入条件，不保证全局最优。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2969,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>套管居中度智能评估</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试井 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>套管居中度智能评估</h1><p class=\"lead\">套管偏心会使环空间隙一侧变窄，增加顶替不均匀的可能。居中度 standoff 可用最小径向间隙与同心间隙之比描述，扶正器布置需要考虑井径和井斜等条件。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一口井 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>扶正器数量预算（个） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"扶正器数量预算（个）\" type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"12\" value=\"6\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 / 不利裕度 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：阈值/真值；绿：学习/优化；蓝：基线。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>优化与均匀布置的模拟居中度</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"优化与均匀布置的模拟居中度\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>同预算下的扶正器位置对照</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"同预算下的扶正器位置对照\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>简化几何响应 + 贪心组合优化；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">不训练机器学习模型；采用组合优化，未模拟受力、摩阻与实际下入条件，不保证全局最优。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":12736,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"centralize\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":6,\"inspect\":\"居中度单位%，设备标记0/1。优化和均匀布置使用相同数量预算；不训练机器学习，几何响应与70%目标均为教学设定。\",\"classes\":[\"见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v)),sigmoid=v=>1/(1+Math.exp(-v));\nfunction rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17);if(TYPE==='centralize')return null;if(TYPE==='quality'){let centers=[[0,0],[0,0],[0,0]],base=[[.2,.8],[.5,.5],[.8,.2]];for(let i=0;i<360;i++){let k=i%3;for(let j=0;j<2;j++)centers[k][j]+=(base[k][j]+(r()-.5)*.14)/120}return{centers,base}}if(TYPE==='loss'){let samples=[];for(let i=0;i<600;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),x=[1,a,b],prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b);samples.push({x,y:r()<prob?1:0})}let w=[0,0,0];for(let e=0;e<350;e++){let g=[0,0,0];for(let d of samples){let p=sigmoid(predict(w,d.x));for(let j=0;j<3;j++)g[j]+=(p-d.y)*d.x[j]}for(let j=0;j<3;j++)w[j]-=.1*g[j]/samples.length}return w}let data=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let q=r(),c=r(),x=[1,q,c,q*q];data.push({x,y:55+40*q-12*c-12*q*q+(r()-.5)*2})}return fit(data)})();\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;const accuracy=(a,b)=>(100*a.filter((v,i)=>v===b[i]).length/a.length).toFixed(1)+'%';\nfunction metrics(items){$('metrics').innerHTML=items.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction run(){let param=+$('param').value,noise=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=param;$('nv').value=noise.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='quality'){let truth=[],pred=[],base=[],amp=[],texture=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let y=i<40?0:i<80?1:2,x=model.base[y].map(v=>clamp(v+(r()-.5)*noise,0,1));x[0]=clamp(x[0]+param/100,0,1);let dist=model.centers.map(c=>c.reduce((s,v,j)=>s+(v-x[j])**2,0));truth.push(y);pred.push(dist.indexOf(Math.min(...dist)));base.push(x[0]<.35?0:x[0]<.65?1:2);amp.push(x[0]*100);texture.push(x[1])}chart('a',[{values:amp,color:'#43836b'}],0,110,'采样序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 0.5 m）','CBL 合成幅度 / mV');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],-.2,2.3,'采样序号 / 0.5 m 步长','0 好 / 1 中 / 2 差（教学编码）');metrics([['多特征准确率',accuracy(truth,pred)],['单幅度基线',accuracy(truth,base)],['训练 / 测试','360 / 120'],['幅度系统偏移',param+' mV']]);$('explain').textContent='360 个训练样本学习 CBL 幅度与地层波纹理代理特征的类别中心；测试不使用真值推理。橙：真值；绿：多特征；蓝：单幅度阈值。第一滑块模拟幅度系统偏移，观察仅靠幅度的误判。纹理是数值代理，不是真实 VDL；较弱套管波一般有利于胶结解释，但微环隙、快速地层等可能干扰，不能由等级直接证明水力封隔。';head=['depth_m','CBL_mV','texture_proxy','truth','multifeature_class','amplitude_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*.5,amp[i],texture[i],v,pred[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='optimize'){let upper=param/100,eff=[],ecd=[],valid=[],best=null;for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let q=.5+i*.03,nq=(q-.5)/3,c=.25+(seed%17)/50,estimated=predict(model,[1,nq,c,nq*nq]),equiv=1.60+.03*q*q+noise*.02;eff.push(estimated);ecd.push(equiv);valid.push(equiv<=upper&&equiv>=1.65?1:0);if(valid[i]&&(!best||estimated>best.eff))best={q,eff:estimated,ecd:equiv}}chart('a',[{values:eff,color:'#43836b'}],30,100,'候选序号（排量 = 0.5 + 序号 × 0.03 m³/min）','代理顶替效率 / %');chart('b',[{values:ecd,color:'#43836b'},{values:ecd.map(()=>upper),color:'#c59048'},{values:ecd.map(()=>1.65),color:'#648eae'}],1.5,2.1,'候选排量序号','演示 ECD / g·cm⁻³');metrics([['可行候选',valid.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 100'],['推荐排量',best?best.q.toFixed(2)+' m³/min':'无可行方案'],['预测效率',best?best.eff.toFixed(1)+'%':'—'],['推荐点 ECD',best?best.ecd.toFixed(3):'—']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成施工样本拟合排量、偏心代理与效率的岭回归模型，再遍历候选排量。ECD 用教学式 1.60 + 0.03q² + 扰动裕度计算，只保留在蓝色下限 1.65 与橙色上限之间的点。第一滑块为上限×100，第二滑块增加保守密度裕度。效率最高的可行候选作为建议；无可行点时明确返回无解，不强行推荐。并非真实水力或完整浆柱设计。';head=['candidate','flow_m3_min','predicted_eff_pct','ECD_g_cm3','feasible','selected'];rows=eff.map((v,i)=>[i,.5+i*.03,v,ecd[i],valid[i],best&&Math.abs(.5+i*.03-best.q)<1e-8?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='loss'){let truth=[],pred=[],baseline=[],probs=[],margins=[];for(let i=0;i<180;i++){let a=r()*2-1,b=r(),prob=sigmoid(-1+4*a+2*b),y=r()<prob?1:0,obs=clamp(a+(r()-.5)*noise,-1,1),score=sigmoid(predict(model,[1,obs,b]));truth.push(y);probs.push(score);margins.push(obs);pred.push(score>param/100?1:0);baseline.push(obs>0?1:0)}function count(a){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&truth[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(truth[i])fn++});return{fp,fn,f:(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%'}}let c=count(pred);chart('a',[{values:probs,color:'#43836b'},{values:probs.map(()=>param/100),color:'#c59048'}],0,1,'独立测试井次序号','逻辑回归风险分数 / 阈值');chart('b',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:pred.map(v=>v*.8),color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline.map(v=>v*.6),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'测试井次（分层显示二元事件）','橙真值=1 / 绿报警=0.8 / 蓝基线=0.6');metrics([['学习模型 F1',c.f],['裕度阈值基线 F1',count(baseline).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['测试漏失事件',truth.reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0)+' / 180']]);$('explain').textContent='600 个合成历史井次通过梯度下降拟合逻辑回归，输入为归一化超压裕度（正值偏危险）和地层弱化代理。180 个独立测试井次按生成概率随机产生事件，因此存在不可消除的不确定性。第一滑块调报警阈值；分数未经真实现场校准，不能报告为现场漏失概率。第二滑块只改变观测误差，不改变同一种子下的事件真值。';head=['well_index','observed_margin_proxy','risk_score','truth_loss','alarm','margin_baseline'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,margins[i],probs[i],v,pred[i],baseline[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='centralize'){let n=60,budget=param,severity=Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>.3+.6*Math.exp(-(((i-35)/12)**2))+.25*r()),places=[],baseplaces=Array.from({length:budget},(_,k)=>Math.round((k+.5)*n/budget));function profile(set){return severity.map((s,i)=>{let dist=set.length?Math.min(...set.map(p=>Math.abs(p-i))):n;let ecc=clamp((.2+.8*s+noise*.2)*dist/14,0,.98);return 100*(1-ecc)})}for(let k=0;k<budget;k++){let best=null;for(let p=0;p<n;p++){if(places.includes(p))continue;let values=profile([...places,p]),cost=values.reduce((s,v)=>s+Math.max(0,70-v)**2,0);if(!best||cost<best.cost)best={p,cost}}places.push(best.p)}let optimized=profile(places),baseline=profile(baseplaces);chart('a',[{values:optimized,color:'#43836b'},{values:baseline,color:'#648eae'},{values:optimized.map(()=>70),color:'#c59048'}],0,105,'井段序号（深度 = 2000 + 序号 × 2 m）','模拟居中度（standoff）/ %');chart('b',[{values:places.length?Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>places.includes(i)?1:0):[],color:'#43836b'},{values:Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>baseplaces.includes(i)?.7:0),color:'#648eae'}],0,1.2,'井段序号（绿优化位置 / 蓝均匀位置）','位置指示（绿=1，蓝=0.7）');let cover=a=>(100*a.filter(v=>v>=70).length/n).toFixed(1)+'%';metrics([['优化达标比例',cover(optimized)],['均匀布置达标比例',cover(baseline)],['扶正器预算',budget+' 个'],['优化最小居中度',Math.min(...optimized).toFixed(1)+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='用简化偏心—距离响应预测居中度 S = 100×(1−e/c)，e 为偏心距、c 为同心径向间隙。按预算逐个选位置，使低于教学目标 70% 的平方缺口总和最小；对比同预算均匀布置。第二滑块增加井段不利程度。属于贪心组合优化，不训练机器学习模型，也不保证全局最优；未考虑扶正器载荷、摩阻、弯曲或可下入性。70% 仅为教学目标。';head=['depth_m','severity_proxy','optimized_standoff_pct','uniform_standoff_pct','optimized_device','uniform_device'];rows=optimized.map((v,i)=>[2000+i*2,severity[i],v,baseline[i],places.includes(i)?1:0,baseplaces.includes(i)?1:0]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',blob=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='cement-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=5;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent=TYPE==='centralize'?'几何响应与贪心组合优化；不训练机器学习模型。目标为低于70%的居中度平方缺口之和，未保证全局最优。':JSON.stringify(model)};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.slice(1).map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j+1]==='number'?row[j+1].toFixed(4):row[j+1])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='quality'||TYPE==='loss'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='optimize'?+(r[4]===0):Math.max(0,70-r[2])),max=Math.max(1,...a),label=TYPE==='optimize'?'不可行候选位置：高柱表示不满足压力窗口':TYPE==='centralize'?'逐井段未达教学居中度目标的缺口（百分点）':'逐点分类错误：高柱表示判错';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(130-v/max*85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(1,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+(v?85*v/max:3)+'\" fill=\"'+(v?'#b26a39':'#2f7d6b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=5;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;}